※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4634

※ An answer in the image travels without its allocator; one that may be made in
※ an arena as well carries one, so `⎕static` is not named beside anything else.

fn named(a: &mut arena, c: bool) → str in a, ⎕static:
    if c: "yes" else: "no"

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    0u6
